                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Define primary and secondary customer segments.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Identify customer problems and unmet needs.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Analyze customer purchasing behavior and decision-making factors.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Prioritize segments based on market opportunity and product fit.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> Create targeted messaging for different customer groups.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
